# SYNTHETIC. Not evidence. Twenty stage lines, no bench and no client= field: this is the
# shape an UNINSTRUMENTED stage line has (and the shape a flight has before
# patches/proposed/pong-metal-client-gap.patch is carried). It exists so the optional
# client= group is exercised in both directions - a parser that only ever sees the field
# present cannot prove it degrades to unmeasured when the field is absent.
Pong Metal: gpuonly=1
